<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h2>Good News, {{name}}!</h2>
    <p>Your pre-order for <strong>{{productName}}</strong> has arrived at our warehouse.</p>
    <p>Please finalize your payment to have it shipped.</p>
    <p><strong>Remaining Balance:</strong> {{formattedRemaining}}</p>
    
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
        <a href="{{paymentLink}}" 
           style="background-color: #000; color: white; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold;">
           Pay Now
        </a>
    </div>
    <p>This link is valid for 7 days.</p>
</div>
